    "detailed_description": "<strong>Dust Kingdom is a roguelike with beat'em up fights, playable from 1 to 4 players in cooperation and versus.<br><br>A deadly red fog covers the kingdom, swarms of enemies emerge from it, the survivors joined a coliseum prison, the last bastion against this deadly threat, expeditions are sent in the hope of slowing down the hordes and finding the origin of this evil.</strong><br><br><strong>Go on expeditions:</strong> Alone or in a group of 4, choose from a lot of characters to fight the hordes, and maybe find the source of fog.<br><br><strong>Explore the map:</strong> The destination does not change but several paths are possible to reach it, explore the different places of the kingdom in search of clues.<br><br><strong>Bring back other survivors:</strong> Help the survivors you find on your way to reach the bastion, and benefit from their help for the next expeditions.",
